  "body": "### Added\r\n- `PutDataTag.APPLICATION_AID` to modify the AID of the current application (tag 4Fh).\r\n- `PutDataTag.STORED_VALUE_LINK` to link the current application to a Stored Value application, or to cancel such a link (tag D0h).\r\n### Changed\r\n- `TransactionManager.preparePutData` now specifies the secure session requirements per tag: `APPLICATION_AID` and `STORED_VALUE_LINK` require a secure session opened in symmetric crypto mode, and the card also requires the `PERSONALIZATION` level.\r\n"
